Package: wattline-bt
Version: 0.1.6
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Keith <keith@kodi.tv>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: bluez-daemon, dbus, kmod-bluetooth
Description: Bluetooth stack dependencies for wattlined (USB BLE dongle). Requires a CSR8510-class adapter, which kmod-bluetooth drives with the stock btusb.ko. Other chipsets are unsupported; the GL-X3000 kernel lacks the RTL/BCM/MTK btusb sub-drivers.
